{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"scripts/verify-harnesses.sh","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-28T04:18:27.035395Z","id":"916d8e71b27e1087cf74c0cafe2474a6dd49b33fab28a21bb5dcd40db292b296","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"c22e973765b3c9637692aaf9ba4ca88cd5fffa4b23fa82b574cddef417f6321f","summary":"The code this concerns moved to scripts/verify-harnesses.py (the Perl program became Python); the record is re-recorded there as 43a70be7d8, so this one is a duplicate to close.","tags":["session:claude-code:52195316-c20b-49ba-9ad3-4026c7d5a1e0"]}}
